        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-51o02k29bbyeytxstzb7f4",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Elephant seal colonies and Great Wall Station"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d06d3df53830d2d5263e56c5333ce276f5a7fcee130f28c01e97803ad20c691b",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-51o02k29bbyeytxstzb7f4",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "On the second day, you visit Elefanteras, an elephant seal colony near the Drake Passage. The group then visits China’s Great Wall Station.\n\nOther sites may be accessible that day, depending on the weather. Your guide will assess conditions on site to decide what is possible.\n\nAt the end of the programme, you return to Punta Arenas."
